lists the commits made during the run, plus a concern if the tree is still dirty. The #6 probe showed a delegated Claude commits on its own branch.\n6. **MCP:** the old MCP `cursor_run` path does not take the file lock. That gap is accepted until #13 deletes MCP.\n7. **Dead supervisor** (deferred from #7): stale-heartbeat handling belongs here.\n--\n(eval):1: ===== not found"}
